{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/Wishlist_Now!.png?t=1747388116\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ClusterCluck</strong> is a chaotic and fun-packed action game where crazy chickens battle each other in intense showdowns\u2014or sometimes team up to defend themselves against common enemies. With diverse game modes, dynamic encounters, and over-the-top chicken action, chaos is always guaranteed!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/GifLook.gif?t=1747388116\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736680?t=1747388116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/7a1789ca97bfb44928085b622115e3e066199d42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747388116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/264ff5dc42ce8b1b528ecd7f3f1a7be4e637ced0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747388116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/264ff5dc42ce8b1b528ecd7f3f1a7be4e637ced0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747388116","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>The ClusterCluck Discord Server is Live!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/DiscordAno.png?t=1747388116\" /></div><strong>\ud83c\udf89 The ClusterCluck Discord Server is Live! \ud83d\udc14</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re excited to announce that the official <strong>ClusterCluck Discord server</strong> is now open!<br>Join our growing community to stay up to date with development news, share feedback, connect with other players, and be a part of the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>What\u2019s Inside?</strong><br>\u2022 Dev updates and patch notes<br>\u2022 Tips, tricks, and strategies<br>\u2022 Community events and discussions<br>\u2022 Feedback &amp; bug report channels<br>\u2022 And plenty of chicken-fueled mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Your voice matters.</strong><br>Whether you\u2019ve got suggestions, bug reports, or just want to share a funny in-game moment \u2014 we\u2019d love to hear from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you there!<br>\u2014 The ClusterCluck Team</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/Wishlist_Now!.png?t=1747388116\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ClusterCluck</strong> is a chaotic and fun-packed action game where crazy chickens battle each other in intense showdowns\u2014or sometimes team up to defend themselves against common enemies. With diverse game modes, dynamic encounters, and over-the-top chicken action, chaos is always guaranteed!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/GifLook.gif?t=1747388116\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Alperen Puren"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/4dea4c11f7091fc4f2dcb94142628906e44405cf/header.jpg?t=1747388116","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"ClusterCluck","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Alperen Puren"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/d6df2ae3eed4298130fb33f8e4160df0fe1204be/ss_d6df2ae3eed4298130fb33f8e4160df0fe1204be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747388116","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/d6df2ae3eed4298130fb33f8e4160df0fe1204be/ss_d6df2ae3eed4298130fb33f8e4160df0fe1204be.600x338.jpg?t=1747388116"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/0589bff4c6323f3e1f56d89a260b8d42b1f9cf33/ss_0589bff4c6323f3e1f56d89a260b8d42b1f9cf33.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747388116","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic